  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "With the removal of fcrepo-transform Solr indexing was unavailable. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This was fixed with ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/pull/110"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/pull/110",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Once ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo4-vagrant-base-box/pull/6"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo4-vagrant-base-box/pull/6",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " is merged, we can once again use Solr indexing in vagrant.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "But we need to use the correct version of fcrepo-camel-toolbox and install/configure fcrepo-camel-ldpath.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
