  "description": "<p>With the removal of fcrepo-transform Solr indexing was unavailable. </p>\n\n<p>This was fixed with <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/pull/110\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/pull/110</a></p>\n\n<p>Once <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo4-vagrant-base-box/pull/6\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo4-vagrant-base-box/pull/6</a> is merged, we can once again use Solr indexing in vagrant.</p>\n\n<p>But we need to use the correct version of fcrepo-camel-toolbox and install/configure fcrepo-camel-ldpath.</p>",
